      "title": "Ukraine drones strike Russia’s e-commerce giant Wildberries, hit 20 warehouses",
      "description": "Ukraine's targeted drone strikes are wreaking havoc on Russian e-commerce hubs, particularly affecting Wildberries, one of the largest online retailers. The damage has led to significant inventory losses and logistical challenges for tens of thousands of small enterprises. As a result, sales and delivery operations at Wildberries' pickup locations are severely disrupted. The Russian central bank is closely tracking the potential for inflation amidst these ongoing supply chain complications.",
